course: dictionary
lesson: 2230
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Many words have more than one meaning, and the sentence tells you which one is meant. The word cow is a good example. Most of the time it means a big farm animal, but the words around it can show another meaning. Check the clues before you decide.
explain: «The farmer milked the cow before breakfast.» Milked is the clue: this cow is an animal that gives milk. Try your meaning in the sentence. It still makes sense, so you have chosen the right one.
explain: Sometimes a word means something new in a different setting. Female elephants and whales are also called cows, so in a sentence about a female whale, cow means a whale, not a farm animal. Always ask: does my meaning fit this sentence?
explain: Slang can change a word's meaning again. In Chinese, «tài niú le!» literally means "too cow", but it is used to mean awesome. A dictionary tells you what a word means, and the sentence tells you how it is being used.
fact: Cow means a big farm animal that gives milk and says «moo».
fact: A cow is the female of cattle; the male is a bull and the baby is a calf.
fact: Female elephants and whales are also called cows.
fact: Cow can be a verb too, but this is rare: to cow someone means to frighten them.
fact: Milk, cheese and butter often come from cows.
exercise: «The farmer milked the cow before breakfast.» What is a cow in this sentence? | A kind of dance | A small bird | *A big farm animal that gives milk | A type of tree
exercise: What is the baby of a cow called? | A foal | A lamb | *A calf | A bull
exercise: In Chinese, «tài niú le!» literally means "too cow". What does it mean as slang? | *Awesome | Too big to move | Angry at a cow | Very sleepy
test: In the sentence «The cow chewed grass in the field.», what did the cow eat? | Cake | *Grass | Fish | Cheese
test: Female elephants can also be called cows. What is a female elephant called? | A calf | A mare | A bull | *A cow
exam: «Sam saw a cow and a bull in the field, and the calf was small.» Which animal is the baby? | A cow | A farmer | *A calf | A bull
